zh/ayah/74-55.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Muddaththir 74:55 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, tentu dia mengambil pelajaran darinya.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Muddaththir\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/74.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 55\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/74-55.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/74.html\">Surah Al-Muddaththir</a> › Ayat 55</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Muddaththir 74:55</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَمَن شَاءَ ذَكَرَهُ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, tentu dia mengambil pelajaran darinya.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأثبت مشيئة العبد، وأخبر أنها لا تكون إلا بمشيئة الرب<cite>«منهاج السنة النبوية في نقض كلام الشيعة القدرية» 3/111</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولا يكفي في وقوع الفعل مشيئة الله للعبد إن شاءه فقط، فإن العبد قد يشاء الفعل، ولا يقع، فإن مشيئته ليست موجبة، ولا تلزمه، بل لا بد من مشيئة الله له أن يفعل،<cite>«إعلام الموقعين عن رب العالمين» 4/52</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s74a55\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/74-48.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (74:48)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/74-56.html\">Ayat berikutnya (74:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/74-56.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Muddaththir 74:56 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan mereka tidak akan mengambil pelajaran darinya (Al-Qur`an) kecuali (jika) Allah menghendakinya. Dialah Tuhan yang patut (kita) bertakwa kepada-Nya dan y\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/74-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/74-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/74-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"altern